# Absenta Development Workflow - Complete Guide

## 🚀 Development Workflow Overview

**Absenta Development Workflow** adalah panduan lengkap untuk development, testing, dan deployment sistem Absenta dengan best practices yang terstruktur dan efisien.

## 📋 Development Phases

### Phase 1: Planning & Setup
```bash
# 1. Project Setup
git clone <repository-url>
cd absenta-optimize-old
npm install

# 2. Environment Setup
cp .env.example .env
# Configure database, Redis, and other services

# 3. Database Setup
mysql -u root -p < absenta13.sql
# Verify database connection

# 4. Start Development Servers
npm run dev:backend  # Backend server
npm run dev:frontend # Frontend server
```

### Phase 2: Feature Development
```bash
# 1. Create Feature Branch
git checkout -b feature/new-feature-name

# 2. Development Process
# - Write code following Cursor Rules
# - Implement tests
# - Update documentation
# - Test locally

# 3. Commit Changes
git add .
git commit -m "feat: add new feature description"

# 4. Push and Create PR
git push origin feature/new-feature-name
# Create Pull Request
```

### Phase 3: Testing & Quality Assurance
```bash
# 1. Run Tests
npm run test
npm run test:e2e
npm run test:coverage

# 2. Code Quality Checks
npm run lint
npm run type-check
npm run format

# 3. Security Audit
npm audit
npm run security:scan

# 4. Performance Testing
npm run test:performance
npm run test:load
```

### Phase 4: Deployment
```bash
# 1. Build Production
npm run build

# 2. Deploy to Staging
npm run deploy:staging

# 3. Deploy to Production
npm run deploy:production

# 4. Post-deployment Verification
npm run health:check
npm run smoke:test
```

