### Backup Strategy
```bash
# Database backup
mysqldump -u root -p absenta > backup_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).sql

# File backup
tar -czf files_backup_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).tar.gz uploads/ logs/

# Automated backup script
#!/bin/bash
DATE=$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)
mysqldump -u root -p absenta > /backups/db_$DATE.sql
tar -czf /backups/files_$DATE.tar.gz uploads/ logs/
find /backups -name "*.sql" -mtime +7 -delete
find /backups -name "*.tar.gz" -mtime +7 -delete
```

